L1: Oxidative Stress, Mitochondrial Function and Adaptation to Exercise: New Perspectives in Nutrition
L2: Life (2021)
L3: Nancy Vargas-Mendoza, Marcelo Angeles-Valencia, Ángel Morales-González, Eduardo Osiris Madrigal-Santillán, Mauricio Morales-Martínez, Eduardo Madrigal-Bujaidar, Isela Álvarez-González, José Gutiérrez-Salinas, César Esquivel-Chirino, Germán Chamorro-Cevallos, José Melesio Cristóbal-Luna, José A. Morales-González
